  /** device_type: mobile, desktop, tablet or bot; country_code: two letters; language: the first language of Accept-Language (en-us; use starts_with ar for every Arabic variant); time_hour 0-23 and day_of_week 1 (Monday) to 7 in the rule's timezone */
